(5979141, 873432, 96751, '<td valign="top">Looks like Warrick Brown :-)<br/> <br/>Nice, moody shot.  Love the bit of lighting on his left arm.</td>', 'Looks like Warrick Brown :-) Nice, moody shot.  Love the bit of lighting on his left arm.', '2010-04-29 12:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
