(5980514, 875106, 112828, '<td valign="top">In honor of [user]K10Guy[/user] I am doing 10 comments tonight, here is yours :)<br/> <br/>Sassy and chic.  Your choice of location is great, and the fashion is tasteful (except those damned tassels on the shoes.. Horrible).  You have a great image here that appeals to the eye, and is quite nicely composed per the rule of thirds.</td>', 'In honor of [user]K10Guy[/user] I am doing 10 comments tonight, here is yours :) Sassy and chic.  Your choice of location is great, and the fashion is tasteful (except those damned tassels on the shoes.. Horrible).  You have a great image here that appeals to the eye, and is quite nicely composed per the rule of thirds.', '2010-04-30 02:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980539, 875088, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice set up :)</td>', 'Nice set up :)', '2010-04-30 03:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980542, 874774, 5728, '<td valign="top">As you would say in your own words "niiiiiiice" :)</td>', 'As you would say in your own words "niiiiiiice" :)', '2010-04-30 03:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980639, 874957, 114682, '<td valign="top">Is this Boy George there? Classy shot!</td>', 'Is this Boy George there? Classy shot!', '2010-04-30 07:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980642, 872456, 114682, '<td valign="top">Nice model and composition! The sidelight over the modell looks a bit too arteficial though, in combination with natural light otherwise in the picture, I think. Still a very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice model and composition! The sidelight over the modell looks a bit too arteficial though, in combination with natural light otherwise in the picture, I think. Still a very nice photo.', '2010-04-30 07:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980644, 875099, 114682, '<td valign="top">The model a bit too serious, nice colours and light.</td>', 'The model a bit too serious, nice colours and light.', '2010-04-30 07:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980646, 874453, 114682, '<td valign="top">I think that the face and upper body are overexposed, maybe it was the intention, but I think it doesn''t work here. Otherwise, nice idea and colours.</td>', 'I think that the face and upper body are overexposed, maybe it was the intention, but I think it doesn''t work here. Otherwise, nice idea and colours.', '2010-04-30 07:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980647, 875187, 114682, '<td valign="top">Nice ghost effect.</td>', 'Nice ghost effect.', '2010-04-30 07:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980755, 874655, 113419, '<td valign="top">this photo works well on so many levels.  the ply board back drop fits perfect with the burlap outfit.  the shadow serves well here as it sets the model apart from the backdrop.  the lipstick smear is that added touch of color and interest - WELL DONE!  the only thing I can see that would make this better is the models right arm is hidden; she should have popped her elbow out to the side to make a triangle and some bend or an awkard stance in her legs would have added to her look</td>', 'this photo works well on so many levels.  the ply board back drop fits perfect with the burlap outfit.  the shadow serves well here as it sets the model apart from the backdrop.  the lipstick smear is that added touch of color and interest - WELL DONE!  the only thing I can see that would make this better is the models right arm is hidden; she should have popped her elbow out to the side to make a triangle and some bend or an awkard stance in her legs would have added to her look', '2010-04-30 08:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980757, 875185, 113419, '<td valign="top">the end of the cuff there shouldn''t be covering the watch</td>', 'the end of the cuff there shouldn''t be covering the watch', '2010-04-30 08:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980760, 872159, 113419, '<td valign="top">personally I think this photo would be better if the flower were in black and white too; otherwise a good image</td>', 'personally I think this photo would be better if the flower were in black and white too; otherwise a good image', '2010-04-30 08:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980762, 874392, 68573, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2010-04-30 08:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980763, 874889, 113419, '<td valign="top">I like that the model and the painting both have hats - good job</td>', 'I like that the model and the painting both have hats - good job', '2010-04-30 08:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980764, 874774, 68573, '<td valign="top">Excellent image</td>', 'Excellent image', '2010-04-30 08:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980766, 871826, 68573, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems to be a bit flat on this one. A bit varied lighting would have made this even better.</td>', 'The lighting seems to be a bit flat on this one. A bit varied lighting would have made this even better.', '2010-04-30 08:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980851, 875106, 68573, '<td valign="top">Wow thats cool, suits the challenge so well</td>', 'Wow thats cool, suits the challenge so well', '2010-04-30 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5980857, 875088, 105957, '<td valign="top">Cool picture! Love the lighting and the smoke. This one is for sure one of the top 3 IMO:-)...and I''m pretty sure I know who''s picture this is;-)</td>', 'Cool picture! Love the lighting and the smoke. This one is for sure one of the top 3 IMO:-)...and I''m pretty sure I know who''s picture this is;-)', '2010-04-30 10:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
