(5981324, 874672, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''ve decided to comment on every shot in this challenge, since I''m sitting at 1 comments, and I''d rather try and take a positive approach to this rather than simply whining about my score: <br/> <br/>Perhaps just a little too background-busy for my tastes, and the white-balance seems a little off. (Possibly my monitor)</td>', 'I''ve decided to comment on every shot in this challenge, since I''m sitting at 1 comments, and I''d rather try and take a positive approach to this rather than simply whining about my score:  Perhaps just a little too background-busy for my tastes, and the white-balance seems a little off. (Possibly my monitor)', '2010-04-30 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981325, 874821, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''ve decided to comment on every shot in this challenge, since I''m sitting at 1 comments, and I''d rather try and take a positive approach to this rather than simply whining about my score: <br/> <br/>Almost disturbing, and could use a little work in contrast I think.</td>', 'I''ve decided to comment on every shot in this challenge, since I''m sitting at 1 comments, and I''d rather try and take a positive approach to this rather than simply whining about my score:  Almost disturbing, and could use a little work in contrast I think.', '2010-04-30 17:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981410, 874774, 34171, '<td valign="top">Nice work.</td>', 'Nice work.', '2010-04-30 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981438, 874916, 69668, '<td valign="top">What a creative and unique image.  So very well done.  The exposure and clarity are perfect, I can see this in any high end fashion magazine.</td>', 'What a creative and unique image.  So very well done.  The exposure and clarity are perfect, I can see this in any high end fashion magazine.', '2010-04-30 18:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981774, 874759, 37845, '<td valign="top">An outstanding image that could easily be published in a fashion magazine.</td>', 'An outstanding image that could easily be published in a fashion magazine.', '2010-04-30 23:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981775, 874976, 37845, '<td valign="top">I think the blown out highlights give this shot really add to its effect. Great image.</td>', 'I think the blown out highlights give this shot really add to its effect. Great image.', '2010-04-30 23:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981776, 874829, 37845, '<td valign="top">An image like this belongs in GQ or the style section of Maxim. Well done.</td>', 'An image like this belongs in GQ or the style section of Maxim. Well done.', '2010-04-30 23:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981777, 875074, 37845, '<td valign="top">She is stunning... the vest is very flattering for her lean torso. Great shot.</td>', 'She is stunning... the vest is very flattering for her lean torso. Great shot.', '2010-04-30 23:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981794, 874759, 116499, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It has wonderful movement and is well-composed. Two critiques: there is not enough light on the model''s face (it just needs a little more) and the tie is not very distinct from the shirt, which is a problem if that is the ''product'' of this image.</td>', 'I love this photo. It has wonderful movement and is well-composed. Two critiques: there is not enough light on the model''s face (it just needs a little more) and the tie is not very distinct from the shirt, which is a problem if that is the ''product'' of this image.', '2010-05-01 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981814, 874841, 116499, '<td valign="top">I like that the model isn''t airbrushed. This is a solid photo and I do feel as if I''m being sold make up, particularly eye make up (the lipstick is a little distracting). I love the focus on her eye and how clear, ice-blue it is; I almost wish you''d used a smaller aperture so that her other eye were more in focus, but that''s neither here nor there.</td>', 'I like that the model isn''t airbrushed. This is a solid photo and I do feel as if I''m being sold make up, particularly eye make up (the lipstick is a little distracting). I love the focus on her eye and how clear, ice-blue it is; I almost wish you''d used a smaller aperture so that her other eye were more in focus, but that''s neither here nor there.', '2010-05-01 00:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5981821, 874920, 116499, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image. It forces my eyes to the clothes, which have good textures and patterns. I wish the aperture were a bit small to get more detail in the clothes, but overall this photo works very well as a fashion photo.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image. It forces my eyes to the clothes, which have good textures and patterns. I wish the aperture were a bit small to get more detail in the clothes, but overall this photo works very well as a fashion photo.', '2010-05-01 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
