(5982431, 874721, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it was intentional but the colour popping onto the tree and shirt tails just makes this image look sloppy in my eyes, as does having colour in his legs but not his arms. I would have scored it more highly if it were all colour, or all black and white.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it was intentional but the colour popping onto the tree and shirt tails just makes this image look sloppy in my eyes, as does having colour in his legs but not his arms. I would have scored it more highly if it were all colour, or all black and white.', '2010-05-01 07:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982432, 874997, 101702, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the framing, but I think the subject could have been a bit sharper, and I think I''d have prefered to see more detail in the sky rather than it being blown out.</td>', 'I like the pose and the framing, but I think the subject could have been a bit sharper, and I think I''d have prefered to see more detail in the sky rather than it being blown out.', '2010-05-01 07:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982436, 875002, 101702, '<td valign="top">A flower and two ants? As great as this photo is on it''s own merits, I can''t see any link to fashion, whatsoever. A complete shoehorn in my view, and although this will probably score highly as a technically very competent picture, I''m dropping a couple of points for my perception that it DNMC.</td>', 'A flower and two ants? As great as this photo is on it''s own merits, I can''t see any link to fashion, whatsoever. A complete shoehorn in my view, and although this will probably score highly as a technically very competent picture, I''m dropping a couple of points for my perception that it DNMC.', '2010-05-01 08:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982438, 872159, 101702, '<td valign="top">I like colour popping when done well, but I''m afraid I''m not so keen on this one. If the red and green were a little more subtle I think it would be a much stronger picture. As it stands they immediately drag the eye down from the model. A hint of colour there rather than full colour would be better in my opinion. Also, the desat was not specific enough - there are stabs of red still visible on his knuckles, nose, hairline and ear which I find really distracting.</td>', 'I like colour popping when done well, but I''m afraid I''m not so keen on this one. If the red and green were a little more subtle I think it would be a much stronger picture. As it stands they immediately drag the eye down from the model. A hint of colour there rather than full colour would be better in my opinion. Also, the desat was not specific enough - there are stabs of red still visible on his knuckles, nose, hairline and ear which I find really distracting.', '2010-05-01 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982439, 874864, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice knives, but I''m not getting any link to "fashion" other than your title. A complete shoehorn in my opinion and therefore I''m dropping a couple of points from my score for my perception that it DNMC.</td>', 'Nice knives, but I''m not getting any link to "fashion" other than your title. A complete shoehorn in my opinion and therefore I''m dropping a couple of points from my score for my perception that it DNMC.', '2010-05-01 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982442, 874923, 101702, '<td valign="top">Love the model, the pose, the colour, the composition - pretty much everything about the shot, except that the shot doesn''t appear to be sharp enough around her face. Perhaps a tiny splash more light on the left of her face would help lift the shot too. On the whole though, a really nice effort.</td>', 'Love the model, the pose, the colour, the composition - pretty much everything about the shot, except that the shot doesn''t appear to be sharp enough around her face. Perhaps a tiny splash more light on the left of her face would help lift the shot too. On the whole though, a really nice effort.', '2010-05-01 08:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982448, 875117, 27608, '<td valign="top">This shot is most excellent!  I love the colour contrast and the angle.  I need to learn how to do the white background stuff.  Is it just a matter of putting up a white background and ensure there''s a lot of light on it?</td>', 'This shot is most excellent!  I love the colour contrast and the angle.  I need to learn how to do the white background stuff.  Is it just a matter of putting up a white background and ensure there''s a lot of light on it?', '2010-05-01 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
