(5982492, 875088, 101702, '<td valign="top">The standout entry in my eyes. Surely a contender for the blue. I love the pose, the central composition really works. I really like the way the smoke seems to mirror her pose rather than filling the frame. And there is just the right amount of "strange" to be a proper fashion shot. 10</td>', 'The standout entry in my eyes. Surely a contender for the blue. I love the pose, the central composition really works. I really like the way the smoke seems to mirror her pose rather than filling the frame. And there is just the right amount of "strange" to be a proper fashion shot. 10', '2010-05-01 09:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5982493, 874774, 101702, '<td valign="top">One of three standout images in this challenge and certainly a ribbon contender. Model, pose, lighting, tones, costume all excellent and this photo "speaks" fashion to me, of that there is no doubt. 10</td>', 'One of three standout images in this challenge and certainly a ribbon contender. Model, pose, lighting, tones, costume all excellent and this photo "speaks" fashion to me, of that there is no doubt. 10', '2010-05-01 09:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
