(5997135, 875064, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I was surprised this didn''t score a little better.  I thought this was a very simple but rather effective shot.  I like the composition and the choice to use an outdoor setting was good.<br/> <br/>Perhaps the score is not higher because it is not what could be considered a traditional fashion shot.  I find it hard to come up with suggestions to make it better, as I rather like it as is.<br/> <br/>Sorry this was not more in depth.<br/> <br/>Sarah</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I was surprised this didn''t score a little better.  I thought this was a very simple but rather effective shot.  I like the composition and the choice to use an outdoor setting was good. Perhaps the score is not higher because it is not what could be considered a traditional fashion shot.  I find it hard to come up with suggestions to make it better, as I rather like it as is. Sorry this was not more in depth. Sarah', '2010-05-08 11:30:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997202, 875088, 52115, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like how the smoke/fog seems to silhouette the contours of the subject, too. What a lucky coincidence.</td>', 'Nice, I like how the smoke/fog seems to silhouette the contours of the subject, too. What a lucky coincidence.', '2010-05-08 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5997432, 875088, 69325, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the picture, i knew the technicals were great, something i would not have the equipment or possibly the skill to do myself. The pose and bird in hand seemed to escape me. Seemed like weirdness for the sake of weirdness and didn''t really grab me. I voted a 6, however had I known it was your shot I would have voted a 6.</td>', 'I enjoyed the picture, i knew the technicals were great, something i would not have the equipment or possibly the skill to do myself. The pose and bird in hand seemed to escape me. Seemed like weirdness for the sake of weirdness and didn''t really grab me. I voted a 6, however had I known it was your shot I would have voted a 6.', '2010-05-08 16:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5998670, 875088, 87808, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this shot, and I wasn''t sure why i did.  Figured it out, she works her neck like I have never seen before.  She has her head tilted just right to make it the same as her body, which when the neck is extended like that can often be thrown back and look smaller than her body.  This really is a great shot and every-time i look at it I see a little bit more</td>', 'I keep coming back to this shot, and I wasn''t sure why i did.  Figured it out, she works her neck like I have never seen before.  She has her head tilted just right to make it the same as her body, which when the neck is extended like that can often be thrown back and look smaller than her body.  This really is a great shot and every-time i look at it I see a little bit more', '2010-05-09 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
