(6074802, 874821, 91783, '<td valign="top">noticing that this didnt get too many comments during or after, ill expand from my previous comment.<br/> <br/>I love this kind of picture with the model loooking like life sive dolls, although i want to suggest something for next time.<br/> <br/>First off great pose and angle of shot. <br/> <br/>next time, have less clutter, make it more high fashion, and have more contrast. <br/>maybe, as a suggestion, be level with her. Maybe with the idea of high fashion, be in a contradicting setting. i.e. near a metal recycling area, inside old run-down house or building, or in a parking garage with no cars. But with all of this have her over pose as a doll, have her be limp or very ''robot-ish''. creat angles that makes it appealing to the eye.</td>', 'noticing that this didnt get too many comments during or after, ill expand from my previous comment. I love this kind of picture with the model loooking like life sive dolls, although i want to suggest something for next time. First off great pose and angle of shot.  next time, have less clutter, make it more high fashion, and have more contrast. maybe, as a suggestion, be level with her. Maybe with the idea of high fashion, be in a contradicting setting. i.e. near a metal recycling area, inside old run-down house or building, or in a parking garage with no cars. But with all of this have her over pose as a doll, have her be limp or very ''robot-ish''. creat angles that makes it appealing to the eye.', '2010-06-30 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 0),
