(6603312, 874976, 70877, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I''m not in agreement with some of the comments posted. I will agree that you have a very good set-up on the model and the natural lighting in your photo, but in light of the contest that you are entering, the main issue for any marketer would be their product and the advertising of it. By leaving the photo with little contrast and color variations you have taken the element of the product away. Try, instead, to focus on a particular product that is included in your image, eg. the sweater, the shoes, etc., and ''sell'' that product in your image. If it might be the sweater, then you will need to portray an accurate rendering of the colors of the sweater. Also, keep the contrast to a point where you can see the textures and weave of the sweater. Don''t get me wrong, I love the set-up, your model''s expression, the lighting and the relaxed pose of your subject, but my business is marketing and I''m in the business of selling....like you. Great job, keep it up!</td>', 'Unfortunately I''m not in agreement with some of the comments posted. I will agree that you have a very good set-up on the model and the natural lighting in your photo, but in light of the contest that you are entering, the main issue for any marketer would be their product and the advertising of it. By leaving the photo with little contrast and color variations you have taken the element of the product away. Try, instead, to focus on a particular product that is included in your image, eg. the sweater, the shoes, etc., and ''sell'' that product in your image. If it might be the sweater, then you will need to portray an accurate rendering of the colors of the sweater. Also, keep the contrast to a point where you can see the textures and weave of the sweater. Don''t get me wrong, I love the set-up, your model''s expression, the lighting and the relaxed pose of your subject, but my business is marketing and I''m in the business of selling....like you. Great job, keep it up!', '2011-11-25 11:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7233190, 874105, 152252, '<td valign="top">This is funny. Plus a beautiful dog. Very nice portrait. Love the colors.</td>', 'This is funny. Plus a beautiful dog. Very nice portrait. Love the colors.', '2014-06-25 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 0);
